    "RemoteCrab turns your iPhone into a camera, microphone, trackpad and keyboard for this Mac. This short setup grants what macOS needs.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab turns your iPhone into a camera, microphone, trackpad and keyboard for this Mac. This short setup grants what macOS needs."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab 将你的 iPhone 变成这台 Mac 的摄像头、麦克风、触控板和键盘。本向导将完成 macOS 所需的授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also install RemoteCrab on your iPhone from the App Store — both devices must be on the same WiFi.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Also install RemoteCrab on your iPhone from the App Store — both devices must be on the same WiFi."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同时请在 iPhone 上从 App Store 安装 RemoteCrab——两台设备需在同一 WiFi 下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Begin Setup": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Begin Setup"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RemoteCrab drives your Mac's cursor and keyboard from your iPhone — macOS requires the Accessibility permission for that. This step can't be skipped: without it, the trackpad and keyboard don't work.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab drives your Mac's cursor and keyboard from your iPhone — macOS requires the Accessibility permission for that. This step can't be skipped: without it, the trackpad and keyboard don't work."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab 需要从 iPhone 控制 Mac 的光标和键盘——macOS 要求授予辅助功能权限。此步骤不可跳过：没有它，触控板和键盘无法工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grant Accessibility…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grant Accessibility…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授予辅助功能权限…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If no prompt appears, open System Settings → Privacy & Security → Accessibility and turn on RemoteCrab.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If no prompt appears, open System Settings → Privacy & Security → Accessibility and turn on RemoteCrab."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果没有弹出提示，请打开 系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 辅助功能，并开启 RemoteCrab。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A small camera extension lets FaceTime, Zoom, Photo Booth and other apps select “RemoteCrab Camera”. macOS asks you to approve it once, then turn it on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A small camera extension lets FaceTime, Zoom, Photo Booth and other apps select “RemoteCrab Camera”. macOS asks you to approve it once, then turn it on."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个小型摄像头扩展让 FaceTime、Zoom、Photo Booth 等应用可以选择“RemoteCrab Camera”。macOS 会要求你批准一次，然后打开开关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click “Enable Camera Extension” below — macOS will ask you to approve the extension once.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click “Enable Camera Extension” below — macOS will ask you to approve the extension once."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击下方“启用摄像头扩展”——macOS 会要求你批准一次该扩展。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for approval — allow RemoteCrab in System Settings → Privacy & Security.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waiting for approval — allow RemoteCrab in System Settings → Privacy & Security."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待批准——请在 系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 中允许 RemoteCrab。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open System Settings → General → Login Items & Extensions, then turn on RemoteCrab under Camera Extensions.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open System Settings → General → Login Items & Extensions, then turn on RemoteCrab under Camera Extensions."
